@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state Waiting <<state>>
state Active <<state>>
state Expired <<state>>
state Archived <<state>>

[*] --> Waiting : Initialized

Waiting --> Active : Current Date >= Start Date
Active --> Expired : Current Date >= Finish Date
Expired --> Archived : Current Date >= Expiration + 1 Year
Archived --> [*] : End

@enduml
